figured.\",\n     \"when\": \"An unauthenticated client calls the staff authorization-URL operation.\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the returned value is the configured URL.\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.5\",\n     \"given\": \"A customer submits an unknown email address or an incorrect password.\",\n     \"when\": \"The customer calls the sign-in operation for each case.\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status and error body are the same for both cases, and no challenge value or authenticated result is returned.\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.6\",\n     \"given\": \"A customer submits an expired or previously used code, attempts sign-in for a deactivated account, or calls the staff authorization-URL operation while its URL is unconfigured.\",\n     \"when\": \"The corresponding contracted operation is called.\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status and error body match a declared failure response, and no authenticated result or unusable authorization URL is returned.\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"id\": \"AC-4.7\",\n     \"given\": \"A customer has exceeded the deployment-configured verification or resend attempt limit.\",\n     \"when\": \"The customer submits another code verification or resend request.\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is a declared failure status and no authenticated result or additional one-time-code email message is issued.\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"REQ-5\",\n   \"ears\": \"The Meridian API shall validate staff identities using the configured Meridian Microsoft identity provider, map authenticated staff identities to active persisted accounts, and enforce contracted customer-organisation, staff-role, warehouse-scope, Auditor read-only, and account-status restrictions on every operation.\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-2\",\n    \"I-3\",\n    \"Q