e stock list reports both quantities without merging receipt records.\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"id\": \"AC-7.3\",\n     \"given\": \"A receipt expiry date is before the current date, or release is attempted when expiry is within 30 days of receipt.\",\n     \"when\": \"The receipt or release action is submitted.\",\n     \"then\": \"The response status is 400 or 409 as defined by the operation and the receipt or release status value is not changed to Released.\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"id\": \"AC-7.4\",\n     \"given\": \"A valid supplier-format logger file or separate evidence file is available for an existing receipt.\",\n     \"when\": \"The file is uploaded through its contracted receipt operation and the receipt is subsequently fetched.\",\n     \"then\": \"The response contains the receipt record or action result and a subsequent receipt response contains the stored file-related record or processed readings.\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"id\": \"AC-7.5\",\n     \"given\": \"A handling unit has positive available quantity at a warehouse location.\",\n     \"when\": \"A permitted move or opening-stock operation is submitted.\",\n     \"then\": \"The response record contains the resulting quantity and location, and a movement record contains actor, time, source, destination, and moved quantity.\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"id\": \"AC-7.6\",\n     \"given\": \"An authorized Quality Officer records a release decision for a quarantined receipt.\",\n     \"when\": \"The contracted quality disposition workflow records the decision.\",\n     \"then\": \"The response record shows the decision actor and time and the stock status is Released.\",\n     \"level\": \"api\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"REQ-8\",\n   \"ears\": \"When a handling unit reaches expiry, the Meridian API shall automatically mark it Expired, remove it from allocations, record the